@startuml
actor User
boundary "views/declares/index.html.erb" as View
control "DeclaresController" as Controller
entity "Declare Model" as Model
database "Database" as DB

User -> View: Click "Delete" on declare
View -> Controller: Send DELETE /declares/:id request
Controller -> Model: Find declare by ID
Model -> DB: Query declare by ID
DB --> Model: Return declare object
Model -> DB: Delete declare from database
DB --> Model: Return success/failure
Model --> Controller: Confirm delete
Controller -> View: Redirect to declares index page
View -> User: Display updated list of declares
@enduml
